    "description": "Axon Framework is a Java framework for building scalable, event-driven applications using Domain-Driven Design (DDD), CQRS (Command Query Responsibility Segregation), and Event Sourcing patterns. It provides developers with a structured way to model complex business domains while reducing the infrastructure code typically required to implement distributed systems.\n\nAt its core, Axon Framework separates how a system handles commands (writes) from how it serves queries (reads), allowing each side to evolve independently and scale according to demand.",
